{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的扫读负担明显高于Y：S05、S07等段感受短词堆得较密，视线容易来回跳，少数抽象标签也会分散注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更密，但高亮词能迅速抓住心理转折，分开的叙述也保留了人物从想靠近、怕给对方压力，到逐渐承认自己需要这份亲近的完整因果链。水与船的意象贯穿开头到结尾，音乐感受又有更细的动态变化和时间对应，整体更像一段完整、细腻的心理经历；Y读起来更顺，却压缩掉了部分重要层次，例如S11相互需要的心理转变、S13越喜欢越觉得时间短暂的矛盾。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "95ebf1b0-2025-42c2-9dca-c8e0c4840231", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T205405603673Z", "elapsed_seconds": 162.765, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:56:48.384871+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1fdf14f632894b53458f88fbfdfda15f2a3bc6ed0e107e36e0b20b15985066a5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme